  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/897/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"93\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>描述</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">錘（Mace）是在 1.21 版本中引入的新武器</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>您現在可以製作錘物品的變體，進一步強化您的原版遊戲體驗。請參考下方資訊了解可製作的項目。未來可能還會新增更多變體。</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>鑽石錘</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：密度 II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：2800</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特殊效果：主手持握時增加移動速度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊傷害：6</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：0.6&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/489/diamond-mace-recipe.png\" width=\"939\" height=\"353\"></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>烈焰錘</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：燃燒 II、不死剋星 I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：2000</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊傷害：6</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：0.6&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/490/flame-mace-recipe.png\" width=\"936\" height=\"394\"></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>風之劍</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：風爆 II、鋒利 I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：1700</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊傷害：12</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：1.6&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">材質由 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/amadeusmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amadeus</a> 提供</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">備註：此物品技術上仍屬錘類，請使用錘類附魔</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/492/wind-sword-recipe.png\" width=\"936\" height=\"358\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>您可以使用下列任一配方製作原版錘：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/902/mace-vanilla-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"645\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即購買伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 75 折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
